{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Vuoi dire{{TAG:0003:0001:}} la sorella di mezzo?!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}È simpatica, {{TAG:0003:0006:}}ma ogni tanto
riesce a essere proprio acida...{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0007:}}That doesn't matter!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Listen,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} since she's always so helpful
