And you know what she said to me?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}"What's an elevator operator?"{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Can you believe it?!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ay,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} qué más dará eso ahora.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
